OL,3,GNEWSAMonty Don prepares for final
OL,4,AGardeners' World show
OL,5,
OL,6,FMonty Don will host Gardeners' World
OL,7,Ffor the very last time this week after
OL,8,Fmore than 20 years.
OL,10,FIn September, the BBC announced the
OL,11,Fgreen-fingered presenter would depart
OL,12,Fthe show at the end of the current
OL,13,Fseries.
OL,15,FIn a statement, Don said working on the
OL,16,Fshow had been a "deeply rewarding
OL,17,Fexperience", but added: "Now is the
OL,18,Fright time for a change."
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
